{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2023-02-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE RELEASES SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY REPORTED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. SECOND QUARTER FY2023 HIGHLIGHTS SECOND QUARTER ORGANIC REVENUE INCREASED BY 4% (1% REPORTED) TO $271.6 MILLION AND 5% (3% REPORTED) IN THE FIRST HALF OF FISCAL 2023 TO $541.2 MILLION.'}